<main class="commands-page admin-commands-page">
  <header class="page-heading commands-page__heading"><p class="eyebrow">Chatbot · Administration</p><h1>Globale Commands</h1><p>Globale Commands funktionieren in allen aktiven Bot-Instanzen und haben Vorrang vor User-Commands.</p></header>
  <section class="command-card command-create"><div class="command-card__header"><div><h2>Globalen Command speichern</h2><p>Ein vorhandener globaler Command mit gleichem Namen wird aktualisiert.</p></div></div><form class="command-form" method="POST" action="/Admin/Commands"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{data.csrf_token}}"><label for="global-command-name">Name <small>ohne Prefix, z. B. discord</small></label><input id="global-command-name" name="name" maxlength="32" pattern="[a-z0-9_]+" placeholder="discord" required><label for="global-command-description">Beschreibung <small>optional</small></label><input id="global-command-description" name="description" maxlength="255" placeholder="Link zum Community-Server"><label for="global-command-response">Antwort</label><textarea id="global-command-response" name="response_template" maxlength="400" placeholder="Unser Discord: …" required></textarea><div class="command-form__actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Globalen Command speichern</button><span>Maximal 400 Zeichen</span></div></form></section>
  <section class="command-card"><div class="command-card__header"><div><h2>Verwaltete globale Commands</h2><p>Diese Liste wird allen Nutzern schreibgeschützt angezeigt.</p></div></div>{{#if data.commands.length}}<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table command-table"><thead><tr><th>Command</th><th>Beschreibung</th><th>Antwort</th><th><span class="sr-only">Aktion</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each data.commands}}<tr><td><code>!{{name}}</code></td><td>{{#if description}}{{description}}{{else}}<span class="muted">—</span>{{/if}}</td><td class="command-table__response">{{response_template}}</td><td class="command-table__action"><form method="POST" action="/Admin/Commands/{{id}}/Delete"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{../data.csrf_token}}"><button class="button danger" type="submit">Löschen</button></form></td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div>{{else}}<div class="empty-state">Noch keine globalen Datenbank-Commands.</div>{{/if}}</section>
</main>